# Carpetas de Visual Studio
.vs/
**/.vs/
*.suo
**/*.suo
*.user
**/*.user
*.userosscache
**/*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
**/*.sln.docstates

# Carpetas de compilación
[Bb]in/
**/[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
**/[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
**/[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
**/[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/

